### getjobid self
getjobid
--- out
Process 100 runs in job 000123/QSHUSER/QZSHSH.

### getjobid short self
getjobid -s
--- out
QZSHSH QSHUSER 000123

### getjobid pid
getjobid 101
--- out
Process 101 runs in job 000124/QSHUSER/QP0ZSPWP.

### getjobid short pid
getjobid -s 101
--- out
QP0ZSPWP QSHUSER 000124

### getjobid read
getjobid -s 101 | { read name user number; echo "$number:$user:$name"; }
--- out
000124:QSHUSER:QP0ZSPWP

### getjobid several
getjobid 100 101
--- out
Process 100 runs in job 000123/QSHUSER/QZSHSH.
Process 101 runs in job 000124/QSHUSER/QP0ZSPWP.

### getjobid missing
getjobid 999; echo status $?
--- out
status 1
--- err
getjobid: 999: No such process.

### getjobid partly missing
getjobid 101 999 100; echo status $?
--- out
Process 101 runs in job 000124/QSHUSER/QP0ZSPWP.
Process 100 runs in job 000123/QSHUSER/QZSHSH.
status 1
--- err
getjobid: 999: No such process.

### getjobid not a number
getjobid abc; echo status $?
--- out
status 2
--- err
getjobid: abc is not a process ID.

### getjobid bad option
getjobid -x; echo status $?
--- out
status 2
--- err
getjobid: Option -x is not valid.
